(The ATP Depletion Cascade) Tj
T* (ATP depletion is the central event that follows a sustained fall in oxygen delivery.) Tj
T* (The sodium potassium pump consumes a large share of the cellular ATP budget.) Tj
T* (Pump failure causes intracellular sodium and water to accumulate inside the cell.) Tj
ET
