(Morphology of Reversible Injury) Tj
T* (Cellular swelling is the earliest morphological change of reversible cell injury.) Tj
T* (Hydropic change refers to the accumulation of water within the injured cell.) Tj
T* (Membrane blebbing occurs when the cytoskeleton detaches from the plasma membrane.) Tj
